> On Jan 17, 11:42 am, Jorgen Grahn <grahn+n...@snipabacken.se> wrote:
>> IME, Tourists aren't /that/ hard though
> It depends.  The early game can be dicey,
> if the RNG doesn't like you.  Food and HP,
